 {
  "type": "begin",
  "name": "Post Content"
 },
 {
  "type": "text",
  "tag": "p",
  "style": "body",
  "html": "Nordic Anchor &amp; Steel Pile Supply AB (NASPS AB) is proud to contribute to the development of Röda Ulven, which continues to grow its production in Skagshamn through a planned expansion of the existing facility."
 },
 {
  "type": "text",
  "tag": "p",
  "style": "body",
  "html": "The project comprises a new cold storage facility of approximately 500 m², intended to strengthen the company's capacity to handle variations in raw material supply and to ensure a stable supply of surströmming to the market. The investment is an important step in future-proofing production within an industry that in recent years has been marked by limited availability of herring."
 },
 {
  "type": "text",
  "tag": "p",
  "style": "body",
  "html": "The expansion takes place directly adjacent to the existing factory in Skagshamn and is a strategic investment to optimize storage, logistics and quality throughout the entire production chain."
 },
 {
  "type": "text",
  "tag": "p",
  "style": "body",
  "html": "In the project's foundation phase, NASPS AB has supplied 75 R51/29 anchors, contributing to a safe and efficient foundation for the new facility."
 },
 {
  "type": "text",
  "tag": "p",
  "style": "body",
  "html": "The delivery was carried out in collaboration with Nordisk Grundteknik AB as drilling contractor. NASPS AB thanks them for the order and looks forward to further collaborations."
 },
 {
  "type": "end",
  "name": "Post Content"
 },
